    {
      "game": "Yet Another Zombie Survivors",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/14445/450x258/yet-another-zombie-survivors-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789488000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/14445-buy-yet-another-zombie-survivors-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Framedropz",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Yet Another Zombie Survivors is an amazing game and easily one of the most enjoyable survivor-style games I've played.\n\n\n\nThe developers have done a fantastic job supporting the game with frequent updates, constantly adding new content and improving the overall experience. You can really see how much the game has evolved over time.\n\n\n\nWhat I like most is the replayability. There's always another build to try, another upgrade to unlock, or another run to start. It's incredibly addictive in the best possible way you can easily jump in for a quick game and suddenly realize you've been playing for hours.\n\n\n\nGreat gameplay, tons of replay value, and developers who clearly care about making the game better. Definitely recommended!"
    },
